# The JSON sidecars are byte-for-byte derivable from the Markdown's own source
# and duplicate it - knowledge.json alone is 700 KB against 02-KNOWLEDGE.md's
# 633 KB. The Markdown is committed because it is what gets READ, on whichever
# machine the operator is at; these are tool input and are one command away.
#
#     python rebuild/tools/extract_<name>.py
*.json
